{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Protection in AI.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Protection in AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data protection in ai data protection in ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Protection in AI.md","fileName":"Data Protection in AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Protection in AI","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-05 23:09\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Data Ethics and Digital Power]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","Privacy by Design","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Protection in AI.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Protection in AI.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data protection in ai data protection in ai","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Protection in AI.md","fileName":"Data Protection in AI.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Protection in AI","heading":"Data Protection in AI","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Data protection in AI is the set of rights and controls governing how personal data are collected, stored, processed, accessed, corrected, and erased. It treats privacy as an enforceable relationship between a data subject and the organization using the data.\n\nAutomated decision making adds a need for meaningful information about the logic and likely consequences of processing. Erasure, access, and objection rights can restore some control, while [[Privacy by Design]] builds protection into the system rather than depending only on later complaints. Legal compliance remains a minimum; an allowed use can still be manipulative or unjust.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Data Ethics and Digital Power","Privacy by Design","aiethics.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Fu